================================================================================
FAIR REVENUE CLAUSE
================================================================================

Commercial license requirements are based on your organization's annual revenue.
The license is granted per developer seat (each individual who uses the Software)
and is perpetual for the current major version (a one-time fee per seat).

Tier 1 — Annual revenue up to $250,000 USD:
  Free. No commercial license required.

Tier 2 — Annual revenue $250,001 to $1,000,000 USD:
  Commercial license required.
  - Perpetual: $1,200 per seat (one-time, current major version)

Tier 3 — Annual revenue over $1,000,000 USD:
  Commercial license required.
  - Perpetual: $4,000 per seat (one-time, current major version)

Grace period: 90 days from exceeding a tier threshold.

ACADEMIC EXCEPTION:
Students and faculty of accredited educational institutions are exempt from
commercial license requirements, provided their use is non-commercial (research,
coursework, and teaching purposes only).

SCOPE OF THE COMMERCIAL LICENSE:
The commercial license grants only the right to use the Software for commercial
purposes. It is a usage license, not a service agreement. Paying for a commercial
license does not entitle you to any additional deliverable, support, maintenance,
updates, service-level commitment, or warranty beyond what is publicly available
to all users at no charge. The Software is provided "AS IS" to every user equally,
regardless of tier (see DISCLAIMER below). Support, if desired, is available only
under a separate written agreement.

